---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import PosterHeading from "@components/PosterHeading.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About — Roze"
  description="Engineer, writer & maker working where technology meets art and public life."
>
  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[720px] px-6 py-14 md:px-8">
    <p class="mb-4 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-indigo uppercase">
      Engineer · Writer · Maker
    </p>
    <PosterHeading
      text="About"
      as="h1"
      ghost={false}
      class="mb-8 text-5xl md:text-7xl"
    />

    <div class="space-y-5 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed md:text-xl">
      <p>
        I'm an engineer and writer who mostly just follows my curiosity, often
        into the places where technology meets art and public life. That's led me
        to tinker with data visualizations (a few have found their way into art
        spaces), build tools that turned out to be useful for human-rights work,
        spend time on playwriting, and start more small software projects than
        I'd care to count.
      </p>
      <p>
        I studied computer science at the University of Virginia, where I got
        hooked on machine-learning research. Since then I've worked on healthcare
        interoperability for EHRs, spent a stretch as an independent engineer and
        researcher, and these days I'm building AI agents and factories for a
        startup investment firm. Mostly I'm still trying to learn something new
        each time.
      </p>
      <p>
        If any of this resonates — or you just want to trade ideas — I'd love to
        hear from you at <span class="font-mono whitespace-nowrap text-indigo"
          >hi@roze dot dev</span
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
